{"hasca vrihikalayoH": [{"id": "haSca vrIhikAlayoH", "headword": "हश्च व्रीहिकालयोः", "headword_slp1": "haSca vrIhikAlayoH", "fold": "hasca vrihikalayoH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "After the verb हा , also the affix ण्युट् is used when the agent so expressed denotes 'rice' and 'time'.\n\nTerms: हा", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["हश्च व्रीहिकालयोः ३.१.१४८", "३.१.१४८", "३.१.१४८ हश्च व्रीहिकालयोः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["haSca vrIhikAlayoH ३.१.१४८", "३.१.१४८", "३.१.१४८ haSca vrIhikAlayoH"]}], "hasasvatorlaN ca": [{"id": "haSaSvatorlaN ca", "headword": "हशश्वतोर्लङ् च", "headword_slp1": "haSaSvatorlaN ca", "fold": "hasasvatorlaN ca", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "And the affix लङ् (Imperfect Tense) comes after the verb when the particles ह and शश्वत are in connection with it and when the verb denotes past action unperceived by the speaker and before the commencement of the current day.\n\nTerms: लङ्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["हशश्वतोर्लङ् च ३.२.११६", "३.२.११६", "३.२.११६ हशश्वतोर्लङ् च"], "synonyms_slp1": ["haSaSvatorlaN ca ३.२.११६", "३.२.११६", "३.२.११६ haSaSvatorlaN ca"]}], "hastadane cerasteye": [{"id": "hastAdAne cerasteye", "headword": "हस्तादाने चेरस्तेये", "headword_slp1": "hastAdAne cerasteye", "fold": "hastadane cerasteye", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix घञ् comes after the root चि 'to collect' when the sense expressed is that of taking by hand provided it does not refer to stealing.\n\nTerms: घञ्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["हस्तादाने चेरस्तेये ३.३.४०", "३.३.४०", "३.३.४० हस्तादाने चेरस्तेये"], "synonyms_slp1": ["hastAdAne cerasteye ३.३.४०", "३.३.४०", "३.३.४० hastAdAne cerasteye"]}], "haste vartigrahoH": [{"id": "haste varttigrahoH", "headword": "हस्ते वर्त्तिग्रहोः", "headword_slp1": "haste varttigrahoH", "fold": "haste vartigrahoH", "headword_language": "sa", "